          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "The full text is: \"In 2029, AI will not be able to take arbitrary proofs from the mathematical literature written in natural language and convert them into a symbolic form suitable for symbolic verification.\"",
