        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Judgment will be by me, not Gary Marcus.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "Ambiguous whether this means start or end of 2029, so I have set it for the end.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "text": "I will accept if there is an AI that can do this for >=75% of the proofs published on the arxiv math categories in 2029. ",
